<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116256" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤν-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Aeschin.
			3.160
		</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Luc.
			<u>Nigr.</u>
			25
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
			21
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
				bought, for sale,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				71
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶς ὁ σῖτος ὤ.;</span> how's
			corn <i>selling?</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				758
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.</u>
				480
			</span></i>: c. gen. pretii, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματος ἡ ἀρετὴ ὠ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς οὐσίας γάρ εἰσιν . .
				ὤνιοι</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύες</span>)
				<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				76.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θανάτου γάρ ἐστιν ὤνιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					366
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.67K.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ ἀργίας ὤνιον ἡ ὑγίεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.135b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ὤνιον ἐλθεῖν</span> come to
				<i>market,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				127
			</span></i> (dub. cj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥριον</span> codd.);
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤνιον εἶναι</span> to be <i>on
				sale,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				848a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὗ ὁ οἶνος ὤνιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					6.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὗ τὰ βιβλἴ ὤνια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					304
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς Ῥώμην ὤνιος ἤχθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Crass.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκέτας ὠνίους ἐξάγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.680e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀττικὰς ἰσχάδας ὠνίους
				κομισθείσας</span>
			<i>commercially imported</i> Attic figs, ib.<i><span class="en">
				173c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴστε ὀρόβους ὄντας
			ὠνίους,</span> prov. of great distress, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				22.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὤ.</span>”
				<i>goods for sale, marketwares,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.2.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				22.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				8.67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀγορὰν τῶν ὠνίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					799.22
				</span></i>
			 (Cyzicus, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>), cf. Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				41 iii 31
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a <i>venal</i> magistrate, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ στρατηγοῦ ὠνίου ὄντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Din.
					1.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὴν ἀπορίαν ὤνιοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1270b10
				</span></i>
			; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχαιρεσίαι ὤ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
